Z||000000||JBGehling||12-21-2000||01:27 PM||||Hey,<BR>   I was wondering what a kit car frame like this would run me:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/car6.jpg"> <P>How much do kits usually run and where are they found on the internet?<P>Thanks, <BR>Josh||||reg||1
