Z||000005||rockcrawl||12-21-2000||06:00 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lambo.jpg"> <P>I paid $4700 for the basic body kit form D&R Replicars. $100 for a donor Fiero. About $12,000 total cost to complete with TPI 350. Plan on spending a lot more if you can't build it yourself. I sold this one for $30,000.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||7
