Z||000007||rockcrawl||12-22-2000||04:04 PM||||No, it wasn't mine. I sold the car to a guy in Maryland. I subscribe to Kit Car Magazine and Kit Car Illustrated, and I haven't seen it in either magazine. It was actually on the cover once, but just in the background of a shot of the Carlisle showfield (tiny yellow spec). I only had it for about a year. I almost like building them more than driving them!<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
