Z||000009||rockcrawl||12-23-2000||12:08 AM||||Here's an article I clipped from the newspaper a few weeks ago. This is the reason Ferrari kits can be hard to find, especially current production models. Ferrari's lawyers shut them down or force them underground. Fortunately Lamborghini is confident enough in the superior quality of their cars that they are not worried. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ferrarisues.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||mshill||12-23-2000||02:41 AM||||That's one of the reasons that I was not introduced to the fiberglass guys by name.  They have had the Ferrari people on their case before.  He has also said that they will not be doing any more of the later Ferrari models (360 etc) because it is such a pain.<P>||||reg||1
